    {
      "title": "Past tense",
      "explanation": "Take the infinitive, drop -ть, add -л (he / I as a man), -ла (she / I as a woman), -ли (we, you, they): чита́ть → чита́л, чита́ла, чита́ли. The ending follows who did it, not 'I / you'."
